  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An operation in the framework of PDC, between Sweden and Botswana.    Collaboration regarding improving the weather forecasts including     improving the warning system for water flow. A cooperation between    authorities that is based on the parties&apos; joint petition and letters  from concerned ministries in Botswana.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En insats inom ramen f&#xf6;r akt&#xf6;rssamverkan mellan Sverige och Botswana. Samarbetet handlar om att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra v&#xe4;derprognoser inklusive att      f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra varningssystemet f&#xf6;r vattenfl&#xf6;den. Samarbete mellan         myndigheter och bygger p&#xe5; parternas gemensamma framst&#xe4;llan samt brev  fr&#xe5;n ber&#xf6;rda departement i Botswana.</narrative>
  </description>
